@startuml

[*] --> WaitingForInput : Start state

state WaitingForInput <<choice>>
WaitingForInput : entry / Display current time
WaitingForInput : do / Wait for user input
WaitingForInput : exit / User selects power and time

WaitingForInput --> Cooking : TimeSet and PowerSelected

state Cooking <<choice>>
Cooking : entry / Start cooking
Cooking : do / Cook with selected settings
Cooking : exit / Door opened or cancelled

Cooking --> Stopped : DoorOpened
Cooking --> Stopped : CancelCooking

Stopped : entry / Stop state
Stopped : do / Prepare for next use
Stopped : exit / Wait for door closed

Stopped --> WaitingForInput : DoorClosed

Stopped --> [*] : End state

@enduml
